  "limitations": [
    "Timed CPU/latency uses8x64=512attempts perarm; SQL/transaction/lock/plans are separate32attempt diagnostics, not timed SQLcounts",
    "Diagnostic lock-acquisition query time includes network/row-read cost; pure lock wait bounded0..acquisition-query time",
    "Held-through-commit is client-observed; pertransaction duration can increase for a batch while totaltransactions/event decreases",
    "PG CPU eight-block sum has up to80ms quantization per arm (~10ms/tick). Do not infer sub-tick precision; includes owned PG processes, not exact CPU accounting",
    "Owner CPU/heap/RSS describe a shared harness process; PG summedRSS double-counts shared pages; memory not owned by a variant",
    "Late-gap is one-operation structural-only, preserve observed regressions without timing acceptance claim"
